Rule 1 (tensor shapes should be the same)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) = ndim(v_2) ∧ ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) = shape(v_2, i)
>>
Rule 2 (tensor shapes should be compatible for broadcasting)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) = ndim(v_2) ∧ ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) = shape(v_2, i) ∨ shape(v_1, i) = 1 ∨ shape(v_2, i) = 1
>>
Rule 3 (tensor dimensions should be positive)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) ≥ 1 ∧ ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) > 0
>>
Rule 4 (tensor has valid dtype)
{v_1 : tensor} |= dtype_(v_1) ≠ null
>>
Rule 5 (tensor with valid shape)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) ≥ 1 ∧ ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) ≥ 0
>>
Rule 7 (tensor with valid size)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) ≥ 1 ∧ ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) ≥ 1
